{
  "doc_id": "scene.chapter_44_not_like_this",
  "chapter": 44,
  "title": null,
  "when": "Unknown.scene_chapter_44_not_like_this",
  "where": "Realm/Physical/Unknown",
  "scope": "narrative",
  "entities": [
    "geralt",
    "he",
    "kress",
    "mika",
    "she",
    "unknown"
  ],
  "scene_id": "scene.chapter_44_not_like_this",
  "segment_index": 0,
  "segment_count": 598,
  "segment_hash": "dc74fb2ddb2a",
  "block_title": "scene.chapter_44_not_like_this",
  "beats": [
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "CHAPTER 44: THE FINAL LIBERATION"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ACT 1: ONE MORE"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The silence after the Hub Needle’s collapse wasn’t peaceful."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was the quiet of exhaustion, of lungs too tired to cheer, of hands too battered to clap."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Two hundred and ninety souls stood in the dust of the fallen spire, watching the last chroniton arcs fade from the sky like dying lightning."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They were the Legion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "What was left of it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt leaned against a cracked support column, the dragon armor’s breastplate dull with ash and scored by energy fire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The vestigial wing-nubs on his back twitched occasionally, a phantom itch he’d learned to ignore."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika approached, her own armor scuffed, a fresh burn across her left vambrace."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She didn’t speak at first, just followed his gaze westward, where the late afternoon sun painted the distant foothills in shades of blood and gold."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "she",
      "text": "“One more,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt nodded, his eyes never leaving the horizon."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“The last encampment."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Intel from the freed at Hub Needle confirms it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Designation: Nibiru’s Grasp."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Four hundred souls in chains."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Five hundred defenders."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Maybe more.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“They know we’re coming.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“They know three encampments have gone dark. They’ll be ready. Not complacent. Not sloppy. Ready.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika picked up a shattered piece of Anunnaki drone, turning it over in her hand."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“Two hundred and ninety of us."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Half wounded."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "All exhausted."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Five are still in stasis."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "No cosmic cavalry.” She tossed the shard aside."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“It’s a terrible idea.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“It’s the only idea,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt rumbled, pushing off the column. The armor creaked, scales whispering. “We didn’t start this to leave one camp in chains. We finish it. Then we’re done. The mission is complete.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The word complete hung between them, heavy with promise and dread."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Completion meant no more night raids, no more watching friends die under energy whips, no more liberating hollow-eyed survivors who didn’t know how to be free."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It also meant no more purpose."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "What came after?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Around them, the Legion was already moving."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not with the fierce energy of before, but with the grim, automatic rhythm of veterans on a final march."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Weapons were cleaned with methodical slowness."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Last scraps of rations were shared."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Medics moved among the wounded, making hard choices about who could walk and who would be carried."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A young soldier—barely more than a boy, his face still smudged with Hub Needle’s soot—approached, his eyes wide."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“Commander?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Is it true?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The last one?”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Geralt",
      "text": "“Yes,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The boy’s throat worked."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“My sister… she was taken in the last harvest from the Eastern Vale."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They might have sent her…”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“We’ll find out,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika cut in, her voice softening just a fraction. “Get your kit ready. It’s a hard march west.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "As the boy hurried off, Geralt looked at Mika."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“We don’t have to give a speech."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They know.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Mika",
      "text": "“They also know the odds,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Then they know this is what we are. This is the line. One more. Then we rest.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The sun dipped lower."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The order was passed not by shout, but by a look, a nod, a gesture."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Two hundred and ninety turned as one, facing west."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Toward the last slavers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Toward the last fight."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The dragon armor on Geralt’s chest felt cool, inert, a dormant shell."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It hadn’t changed since the crash."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was still just a breastplate and a promise."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "As the column began to move, the shadow they cast was long, thin, and bleeding into the dusk."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ACT 2: THE APPROACH"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The march took two days through broken badlands."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They found the scout’s body on the morning of the third day."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Talven—what was left of him—was strung up on a rusted pylon five hundred yards from the encampment’s outer sensor range."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A clear message."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We see you."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika studied the compound through magnoculars from a rocky overlook."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“Damn.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Nibiru’s Grasp wasn’t like the other camps—makeshift prisons of force-fences and prefab barracks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This was a fortress."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Tiered defensive walls carved from the local red stone, reinforced with shimmering energy lattice."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Gun emplacements at staggered heights."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A central tower with a dish that pulsed slowly, scanning the horizon."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And patrolling the walls, not just the hulking Anunnaki guards, but sleek combat drones, hovering on silent repulsors."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“They’ve had time to prepare,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Kress muttered, crouching beside Mika. “They’ve been watching the other camps fall. They’ve adapted.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt took the magnoculars."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The slave quarters were easy to spot—a sunken yard in the compound’s center, surrounded by high walls."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He could see tiny figures moving listlessly down there."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Four hundred."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Maybe more."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The math was brutal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "he",
      "text": "“Two hundred and ninety,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The command huddle—Geralt, Mika, Kress, and a few scarred squad leaders—was silent."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The wind whistled over the rocks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Could infiltrate,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "one leader, Grenn, suggested. He’d lost an ear to a whip at the second camp. “Small team. Sabotage the power core for the energy lattice. Create a breach.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Scans show the core’s deep inside the central tower,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Kress countered, tapping a crude map drawn from Talven’s earlier, safer recon. “Guarded. And they’ll be watching for that exact play. They know our pattern by now.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Mika",
      "text": "“Then we don’t use our pattern,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A beat of stunned silence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“You’re joking,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Grenn breathed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Kress",
      "text": "“They’ll have the walls fortified, the approaches mined,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Yes,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika agreed. “Which is why that’s the diversion.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She pointed to the map."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“We hit them here, at the main gate, with everything we have that’s loud and flashy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Every charge, every bit of ranged fire, all our remaining heavy weapons."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We make it look like a desperate, furious, final charge.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt saw it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“They’ll commit their reserves to repel it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Pull guards from the interior, especially the inner yard walls.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Exactly. While the main force is tangling at the gate, a small team—five, six max—goes in here.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She pointed to a spot on the northern wall where the stone met a natural rock formation. “It’s the one spot their energy lattice is patchy, blending with the mineral deposits. Talven’s last report noted a blind spot in the drone patrol cycle there, thirty-seven seconds. We get a team over that wall during the cycle, into the lower maintenance conduits. They get to the slave pens, get the doors open from the inside. When the slaves riot, the whole interior defense collapses.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Geralt",
      "text": "“The team in the conduit will be trapped,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“They will,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika met his gaze. “It’s a death sentence. Or a capture sentence, which is worse.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The silence returned, heavier."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This was the calculus of their war."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not glorious charges, but grim percentages."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sacrifice a few to save the many."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Geralt",
      "text": "“I’ll lead the diversion,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Mika",
      "text": "“No,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Absolutely not—”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“It’s the right tactical choice, Geralt, and you know it.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her voice was steel. “You’re too big, your armor signature is unique. They’ll be scanning for you. If you vanish from the frontal assault, they’ll know. I’m smaller, faster, and they won’t be looking for the commander in the pipes.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He wanted to argue."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "To forbid it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But the Legionnaire in him, the strategist, knew she was right."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The emotion clawed at his throat, but he forced it down."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He gave a single, stiff nod."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Kress let out a long breath."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“Alright."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "So we sell the hell out of the diversion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Make it the only fight they think exists.” She started assigning squads, outlining firing positions, fallback lines that weren’t really for falling back, but for dying in place to sell the lie."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "As the others dispersed to prepare, Geralt caught Mika’s arm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“Thirty-seven seconds.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“I know.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“If you’re late…”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Then we die in the pipes, and you die at the gate, and the slaves stay in chains.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She put her hand over his. “We don’t have a better option.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He looked at her, really looked—at the fatigue etched around her eyes, at the determination that held her upright."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“After this,” he said, the vow quieter than a whisper."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“After this, we find a quiet valley.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A ghost of a smile touched her lips."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“Deal.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Below them, the Legion prepared for a terrible, final gamble."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Weapons were checked with solemn care."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Letters to no one were written in the dirt and then scuffed away."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The dragon armor on Geralt’s chest felt like a dead weight."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It had not stirred."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It had not answered his silent, desperate plea for more."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was just armor."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And it would not be enough."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ACT 3: THE ASSAULT FAILS"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The attack began at dusk, when the sinking sun glared directly into the compound’s western sensors."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It started not with a whisper, but with a roar."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Every remaining explosive charge, every rocket, every concentrated energy blast the Legion had salvaged erupted against the main gate in a concussive, blinding wave."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Stone shattered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The energy lattice flickered violently, overloading in a cascade of blue sparks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Klaxons wailed, drowning the world in sound."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“LEGION! WITH ME!”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt bellowed, his voice raw, and charged from the cover of the rocks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Two hundred voices rose in a ragged, furious cry, and they followed him into the killing zone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "For a moment, it worked."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The defenders, concentrated on the walls, were stunned by the sheer audacity of the frontal charge."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The first volley of Legion fire took down a dozen guards, their bodies tumbling from the parapets."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then Nibiru’s Grasp woke up."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The compound didn’t panic."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It reacted."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Blaster turrets emerged from hidden ports in the walls, sweeping intersecting fields of fire across the approach."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The combat drones, held in reserve, streaked from the central tower, raining precise plasma bolts down on the charging figures."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mines, buried and forgotten until now, detonated in geysers of rock and blood."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s world narrowed to fire, noise, and death."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He ran, the dragon armor deflecting glancing bolts that would have cooked a normal man."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He fired his energy staff, the recoil a steady beat against his palm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A soldier to his left vanished in a flash of light."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Another fell, screaming, his leg gone below the knee."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“KEEP MOVING! DON’T STOP!”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He crashed into a low barricade of shattered stone, Legionnaires scrambling in beside him. The charge had stalled barely a third of the way to the gate. They were pinned."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He risked a glance toward the northern wall."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "No signal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "No explosion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Nothing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Thirty-seven seconds."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika was in the pipes, or she was dead."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Sir! Left flank!”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Kress yelled, her face streaked with soot. A squad of Anunnaki shock troops, massive in powered armor, were marching in a solid line from a sally port, heavy repeaters braced on their arms. They began to fire, walking their shots toward the barricade. Stone vaporized."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt raised his staff, but the range was too great."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The charge pinged harmlessly off the shock troops’ armor."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“Fall back to the secondary ridge!” he ordered, the words tasting like ash."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A retreat now would collapse the diversion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It would doom Mika’s team."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But staying was annihilation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They tried to pull back."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was a slaughter."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The drones harried them, the turrets tracked them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Men and women fell with every step."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt found himself as the rearguard, firing, moving, dragging a wounded soldier with him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The vestigial wings on his back trembled uselessly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He made it to the slightly higher ground of the secondary ridge with maybe a hundred and fifty survivors."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They huddled behind rocks, gasping, bleeding."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The charge had failed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The diversion was a bleeding stump."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And the full might of the compound was now turning its gaze outward, hunting."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then, from the corner of his eye, he saw a flicker of movement on the northern wall."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A small explosion—not huge, but precise—at the base of the inner yard wall."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She’d done it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She was in."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The slave pens were breached."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But the compound’s response was instant."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The central tower dish pulsed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A different siren blared—interior breach."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Instead of chaos, the response was chillingly orderly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The shock troops halted their advance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Half the drones peeled away, shooting back toward the compound’s heart."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They hadn’t pulled guards from the interior to the gate; they had a layered, flexible defense ready for exactly this."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The main gate itself then groaned open."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not a crack."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Fully."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And from within marched not more shock troops, but a phalanx of gleaming, golden automata—tall, faceless, wielding staves that crackled with containment energy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Reserve units."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Fresh."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Unbloodied."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Kress",
      "text": "“Oh, gods,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The automata advanced in perfect sync, their staves raising as one."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A wall of golden light erupted from their tips, a shimmering, buzzing net of energy that rolled toward the Legion’s position."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Scatter!”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt roared."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was too late."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The energy net passed over the ridge."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It didn’t burn; it paralyzed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires stiffened and dropped, muscles locked, weapons falling from nerveless fingers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt felt the charge hit the dragon armor."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The scales flared hot, resisting, grounding out the current, but the shock still sent him to his knees, his vision swimming."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The automata kept coming."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Behind them, the shock troops advanced again."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They were being methodically crushed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt forced himself up."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Maybe forty of his people were still moving, struggling to their feet."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The rest lay twitching on the ground, helpless."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The drones began to descend for clean-up shots."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This was it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The failure."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The end of the line."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He saw Mika’s face in his mind."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He’d promised her a valley."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "An energy bolt meant for his head streaked in."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Instinctively, he tried to twist away."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The vestigial wing-nub on his back jerked spastically, pitifully, toward the blast."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was vaporized in a flash of pain."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The bolt slammed into his shoulder instead, spinning him around."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A second bolt came from the right."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A third from directly ahead, from the leader of the automata."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Triangulated."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Kill shot."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He was out of moves."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Out of time."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He had nothing left but the defiant, useless rage in his chest."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And in that nanosecond before the intersecting blasts tore him apart, something within the dragon armor—something ancient, proud, and furious at this indignity—finally snapped."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A voice, not heard but FELT, roared through every fiber of his being, through every scale on the breastplate:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"NOT. LIKE. THIS.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ACT 4: THE EVOLUTION"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The world fractured into light and fury."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Three energy blasts converged on Geralt—from the left, the right, and center—a perfect, inescapable kill box."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "In that sliver of a second before impact, the dragon armor didn’t just react."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It awoke."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"NOT. LIKE. THIS.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The voice was not sound."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was a seismic tremor in his soul, a roar of primal defiance that shook his bones and sparked in his blood."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was Zaron."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The dormant scales on Geralt’s breastplate rippled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then they flowed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was not a gentle transformation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was a violent, rapid reforging."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Metallic, sapphire-blue scales surged from the central core, pouring over his shoulders, down his biceps and triceps in interlocking plates."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They raced down his thighs, over his kneecaps, sheathing his limbs in articulated armor."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It felt less like dressing and more like being claimed—a second skin of immense, ancient power hammered into place."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But the wings—the vestigial, itching nubs—were the true revelation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They didn't grow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They unfurled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "With a sound like a hundred great sails catching the wind, they exploded from his back."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They were vast, semi-translucent, and shimmering with an internal lattice of gold and cobalt energy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They were not feather, not membrane, but solid, sculpted light—dragon wings made real."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The three energy blasts hit."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "CRACK-BOOM-ZZZT!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The world turned white."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But Geralt was not vaporized."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The newly formed wings had snapped forward on instinct, curving around him in a sweeping, protective arc."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They met the blasts not as flesh, but as shields."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The energy detonated against their surface in cascading, eye-searing fireworks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The concussive force slammed Geralt into the dirt, skidding him back ten feet, but he was intact."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The wings shimmered, dissipating the residual energy with a low, angry hum."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence, for one heartbeat."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt pushed himself up on one elbow, coughing dust."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He looked at his arms."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Plated from shoulder to elbow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He looked at his legs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Armored to the knee."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He felt the weight of the wings—immense, powerful, real—anchored to his back."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They thrummed with potential."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Across the field, the lead golden automaton tilted its faceless head."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It recalibrated."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Its staff pulsed, charging another blast."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Move."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The thought was his, but the instinct was the armor’s."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt flexed his legs, and the world sank."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Or he rose."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "With a powerful, thunderclap whoomp of displaced air, the wings beat down once, a mighty, foundational stroke."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He launched upward, not like a man jumping, but like a catapult firing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He rocketed twenty-five feet straight into the air, clearing the ridge in a blur."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The automaton’s blast tore through the space where he’d knelt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He hung, suspended at the apex for a dizzying moment, the wings beating hard to hold position."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The battlefield sprawled below him—the pinned Legion, the advancing shock troops, the gleaming automata."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The perspective was terrifying, exhilarating."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Land."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Now."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He willed himself forward."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The wings angled, caught the air, and he glided."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It wasn’t flight."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was a controlled, powerful, plummeting swoop."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He descended like a falling star, aiming for the center of the automata phalanx."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"FLY!\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "someone, maybe Kress, screamed from below, voice shredded with hope."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He couldn’t."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not yet."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But he could fall with purpose."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He crashed into the middle of the golden constructs, wings tucking in at the last second to become battering rams."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Two automata were smashed apart like porcelain."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He landed in a three-point crouch, the impact cratering the earth."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The remaining automata turned, staves rising."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt didn’t rise."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He sprang—another short, powerful wing-assisted leap, clearing a sweeping staff strike."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He landed behind a construct, his armored forearm flashing out."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The enhanced limb moved with shocking speed and power, shearing through the automaton’s neck-node in a shower of sparks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He was a whirlwind."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The wings were his greatest weapon—not for flying, but for mobility and defense."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He’d leap over a blast, using the height to survey the field."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He’d glide across a gap, closing distance faster than anything on foot."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "When projectiles came, a wing would snap around, deflecting them with a resonant clang."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "An energy net shot from a turret."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He saw it coming, beat his wings once, and vaulted backward, the net snapping shut on empty air."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He landed, skidded, and used the momentum to spin, a wing slicing out like a giant blade to cleave a shock trooper’s weapon in two."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The tide of battle didn't just turn—it reversed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Legionnaires, seeing their commander transformed into a mythical dragon-knight rising from their defeat, found a second wind."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Their ragged cries turned into a unified roar."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"WITH THE COMMANDER! FOR THE LEGION!\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They rose from their cover and charged, not as a broken diversion, but as a hammer behind Geralt’s anvil."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt fought toward the main gate, now a beacon."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A shock trooper leveled a heavy plasma cannon at him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt dropped into a slide, the wings flaring out to either side, acting as stabilizers and shields."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Bolts sizzled over his head."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He came up inside the trooper’s guard, his armored fist driven by the dragon’s strength punching straight through the powered chest plate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He yanked his arm free, turning to face the next threat."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His breath came in ragged gasps."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The evolution hadn't made him tireless."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was draining, a furnace burning hot and fast inside him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zaron’s presence vibrated in his mind, a constant, low growl of satisfaction and impatience."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "More."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Faster."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Can we fly?\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt thought, desperate to get to the interior, to Mika."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A pulse of negation, almost scornful, echoed back."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "An image flashed in his mind: the wings, strong but simple in structure; muscles and conduits not yet developed for sustained lift; a weight-to-power ratio that was still terrestrial."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The understanding was instinctual: Stage 1."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We glide."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not fly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Yet."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But gliding was enough."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Gliding was everything."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He scaled a pile of rubble, beat his wings, and glided over the heads of a stunned Anunnaki squad, landing at the breached main gate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Legion poured in behind him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The interior of Nibiru’s Grasp was chaos—but a chaos they could now use."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The defenders, their perfect discipline broken by the dragon-knight’s rampage, were scrambling."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And from the heart of the compound, a new sound was rising: the roaring fury of four hundred liberated slaves."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika had done her part."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ACT 5: THE LIBERATION & THE CHRONARCH"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The tide had turned, but the tide was not the ocean."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt stood in the shattered gateway, his new wings flexing with a sound like grinding tectonic plates."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Behind him, the Legion poured into the compound, meeting the freed slaves in a chaotic, roaring convergence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Four hundred emaciated, furious souls were tearing apart the inner yard with their bare hands, seizing weapons from fallen guards, turning the Anunnaki’s own architecture into rubble."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But the central tower remained."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A silent, gleaming obsidian spike at the heart of the chaos."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Its energy dish had gone dark."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "No more drones emerged."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It felt not defeated, but waiting."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika emerged from a maintenance conduit, her face streaked with grime and blood that wasn’t her own."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She saw Geralt and for a moment, her fierce composure broke into raw, stunned awe."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“Your… wings.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "he",
      "text": "“They don’t fly,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Good enough.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She nodded toward the tower. “Core’s in there. But it’s… quiet. Too quiet.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt felt it too."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A pressure in the air, a thinning of reality around the tower’s base."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The dragon scales on his arms tingled in warning."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Get the slaves clear,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "he ordered. “Kress! Form a perimeter! That tower is not safe.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "As the orders were shouted, the last of the Anunnaki guards were being overwhelmed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The compound was theirs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But the victory felt hollow, perched on a precipice."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then, the air fractured."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not with a sound, but with a silence so profound it swallowed the riot."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A vertical slit of non-light tore open in front of the tower’s main entrance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It did not glow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It consumed light, a rip in the fabric of the world."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "From the void stepped Ašar-Ku, the Chronarch of Nibiru."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He was not a giant."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He was a convergence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His form was humanoid, but assembled from overlapping, shifting temporal layers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "One moment he appeared as an ancient Sumerian priest-king in layered robes, the next as a sleek, cybernetic entity of golden alloy and crystal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His face was a smooth oval, etched with glowing cuneiform that constantly rewrote itself."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "In one hand he held a staff of intertwined timelines, crystalline and shimmering."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "In the other, he cradled a sphere that contained a swirling, miniature galaxy—the Looking Glass Prime, fused to his being."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He did not speak."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His voice was the grinding of continental plates, the whisper of dying stars, the sigh of a closed timeline."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“You break the vessels, but the wine is already spilled.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The words bypassed ears, imprinting directly into the mind."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires and freed slaves alike clutched their heads, staggering under the psychic weight."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“I did not conquer time. I became it.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt stepped forward, his wings flaring wide, casting a jagged shadow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“You’re a slaver."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And this is your last day.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ašar-Ku’s head tilted."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The cuneiform flared."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“Slavery?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "I am the Gardener."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Pruning the branches of possibility."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "These…” He gestured with his staff toward the cowering slaves."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“…are but seedlings that refused the shape of the pot."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "You are a weed, Geralt of the Dragon."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A fascinating, persistent weed.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Phase I – The Architect Awakes"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ašar-Ku raised his staff."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The cuneiform on his body blazed, and a Chrono-Shield shimmered into existence around him—a sphere of rippling, golden hourglass sand."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "At the same time, he stamped the base of his staff on the ground."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Glyphs of light—Glyphs of Eridu—burned into the stone around him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "From each glyph, a Sumerian war-construct formed: towering, clay golems with lapis lazuli eyes, wielding massive bronze axes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Mika",
      "text": "“Take down the golems!”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Energy staff blasts and physical attacks slammed into Ašar-Ku’s Chrono-Shield."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The damage flashed—cracks appearing—but then the sand flowed backward, and the shield repaired itself instantly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He was rewinding damage faster than they could inflict it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt launched himself at the nearest golem, using a wing-assisted jump to clear its sweeping axe."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He landed on its shoulder, driving his armored fist into its lapis eye."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The construct shattered into dust."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But two more took its place."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“He’s only healing if we attack from one angle!”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Kress yelled, piecing it together. “We need multiple attack vectors! Simultaneous hits!”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt understood."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He beat his wings, gliding high over the battlefield."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“Mika!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Left flank!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Grenn!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Right!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "On my mark!”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He dove, aiming straight for Ašar-Ku’s head."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "As he did, Mika’s squad unleashed a volley from the left, Grenn’s from the right."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Three directions at once."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Chrono-Shield flared, trying to rewind three separate impact points."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It stuttered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A crack webbed across its surface."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Clever weed.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ašar-Ku’s voice held a note of clinical interest. He raised his sphere. The miniature galaxy within spun faster."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Phase II – Devourer of Timelines"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The world… stuttered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt felt a horrible lurch, like a missed step in the dark."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Around him, the battlefield flickered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He saw overlapping images: a Legionnaire falling in two different directions; a slave frozen mid-cheer, then screaming."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“You cherish your past choices. Let us see which one you cannot live without.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ašar-Ku’s staff pointed at Geralt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A wave of temporal force hit him—not physical, but existential."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "TIMELINE COLLAPSE."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A memory, a choice, was targeted."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The moment Geralt chose to crash the Anunnaki city-ship at the Heart of Faraxar, sacrificing his legion to save a continent."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The cornerstone of his legend."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The source of his deepest guilt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The memory didn’t just fade."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was erased."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Unwritten."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt screamed, not in pain, but in profound, terrifying disorientation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He knew he had done something momentous, but the why was gone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The faces of the legionnaires who died for him were blurred smudges."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The weight of the sacrifice lifted, leaving a terrifying, hollow freedom."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Who was he without that burden?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Geralt!”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika’s voice, desperate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He shook his head, trying to reorient."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But the battlefield was fracturing further."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Echo Clones of Ašar-Ku flickered into existence—versions of him from failed futures: one scorched and skeletal, one drowned in cosmic ice, one overgrown with crystalline parasites."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They moved out of sync with the primary, attacking from impossible angles."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ENVIRONMENT HAZARD: REALITY FRACTURE."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Gravity shifted—suddenly pulling sideways."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A freed slave was flung into a wall."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then time flow changed: movements became jerky, fast-forwarding, then slowing to a crawl."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Causality broke; a Legionnaire fired her staff, but the bolt appeared a second before she pulled the trigger."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Chaos."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Absolute chaos."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt fought through the dissonance, his new armor humming as it tried to stabilize his personal timeline."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He saw Mika, moving in slow motion, about to be bisected by an Echo Clone’s temporal blade."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "NO."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He beat his wings, gliding in a distorted, lurching path through the warped gravity field."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He tackled Mika aside just as the blade sheared through the space she’d occupied."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“The shield!”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "she gasped, her words stretched and slow. “The… cylinder… seals!”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Cylinder seals!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The ancient Sumerian administrative tools—also used as ritual foci."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ašar-Ku’s shield was powered by a foundational, orderly principle."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The chaotic reality fracture was a byproduct of his power, not a part of his defense."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The shield’s weakness was symmetry, order."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s eyes scanned the glowing Glyphs of Eridu on the ground."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They weren’t just summoning points."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They were cylinder seal impressions—intricate patterns telling a story."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“We need to align them!”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "he roared, his voice battling the temporal distortion. “Change the story!”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He didn’t know how."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But Zaron did."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The dragon spirit within the armor, ancient and steeped in symbolic power, surged forward."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Knowledge flooded Geralt: the glyphs were a cosmic contract."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ašar-Ku’s story was one of control, of pruning, of enforced order."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They needed to change the narrative to one of freedom."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Mika! Grenn! Everyone! Scar the glyphs! Break the patterns! Don’t destroy—alter!”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He lunged for the nearest glyph, ignoring an Echo Clone’s swipe that grazed his wing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He drove the tip of his energy staff into the intricate design, not smashing it, but carving a new line through it—a wild, uncharted path."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A slave, seeing him, grabbed a piece of rubble and began scratching at another."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "One by one, the Legion and the freed slaves defaced the perfect, orderly glyphs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They introduced chaos."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They introduced choice."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ašar-Ku’s shield flickered violently."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Echo Clones wavered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The reality fractures began to stabilize."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“You introduce… noise.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Chronarch’s voice held the first hint of strain. “But noise is not a song. It is entropy. I shall teach you the cost of dissonance.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Phase III – God Beyond Fate"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Echo Clones dissolved."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Chronarch drew them back into himself, along with all the scattered temporal energy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Looking Glass Prime in his hand blazed like a captured sun."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“I offer you a perfect future, Geralt of the Dragon. The one you secretly crave.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A vision flooded Geralt’s mind, stunning in its clarity: A quiet valley."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika, whole and smiling."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Five, alive and laughing around a fire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The 250, rescued and building homes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "No war."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "No chains."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Peace."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His peace."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "All he had to do was lay down his staff."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Stop fighting."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Accept Ašar-Ku’s order."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was everything he wanted."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was a golden cage."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“This is logical. This is optimal. Why choose suffering?”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ašar-Ku’s true weakness crystallized in Geralt’s mind."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He cannot perceive free will—only probability."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "To him, Geralt was a set of data points: warrior, leader, guilty, loves Mika, desires peace."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The offer was the perfect algorithm to neutralize him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was what Geralt should want."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But free will wasn't about what you should want."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was about what you choose, even against your own interests."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt looked at the vision of peace."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He looked at Mika, real and bloody and fighting beside him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He looked at the freed slaves, choosing to scar the glyphs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He chose the messy, painful, uncertain present."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Geralt",
      "text": "“I reject your future,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He raised his energy staff, not at Ašar-Ku, but at the Looking Glass Prime itself."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He didn’t charge it with destructive force."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He charged it with a single, clear, illogical memory: the moment he first saw Mika, not as a soldier, but as a person."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The moment he chose to trust her against all tactical sense."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A choice that made no probability tables."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A human choice."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He fired."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The energy beam, imbued with that irrational spark of connection, hit the Looking Glass."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The perfect sphere shattered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not with an explosion, but with a sound like a universe sighing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The galaxy within it winked out."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ašar-Ku stared at the broken artifact in his hand, the cuneiform on his face freezing mid-rewrite."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“You… chose… the unpredictable variable."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The null hypothesis.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His form began to destabilize, the overlapping timelines peeling apart."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He was not being destroyed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He was being unmade from relevance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“I am… removed from the equation. Alive… but irrelevant.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Chronarch of Nibiru faded, not into light or darkness, but into a transparent, ghostly afterimage, forever sealed outside the flow of causality—a prisoner of his own perfected, lifeless order."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The central tower groaned."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Without Ašar-Ku’s will, its structural integrity failed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It began to collapse in on itself."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“GET CLEAR!”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt bellowed, shepherding the exhausted, victorious crowd toward the shattered gates."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They stumbled out onto the bloodied plain as Nibiru’s Grasp imploded behind them, a final tomb for the last Anunnaki slavers on the continent."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The sun was rising."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The mission was over."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt stood at the head of a ragged, combined force: the 210 Legionnaires who could still stand, and the 250 freed slaves who chose to follow them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Four hundred and sixty souls, bathed in dawn’s light, finally free."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He folded his new wings against his back, the scales cooling."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They were part of him now."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Stage 1."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A promise of what was to come."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika leaned against him, her breath coming in tired huffs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“A quiet valley,” she murmured, echoing his promise."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "he",
      "text": "“Soon,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "End of Chapter 44"
    }
  ],
  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "CHAPTER 44: THE FINAL LIBERATION"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 1: ONE MORE"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The silence after the Hub Needle’s collapse wasn’t peaceful."
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was the quiet of exhaustion, of lungs too tired to cheer, of hands too battered to clap."
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Two hundred and ninety souls stood in the dust of the fallen spire, watching the last chroniton arcs fade from the sky like dying lightning."
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were the Legion."
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "What was left of it."
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt leaned against a cracked support column, the dragon armor’s breastplate dull with ash and scored by energy fire."
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The vestigial wing-nubs on his back twitched occasionally, a phantom itch he’d learned to ignore."
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika approached, her own armor scuffed, a fresh burn across her left vambrace."
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She didn’t speak at first, just followed his gaze westward, where the late afternoon sun painted the distant foothills in shades of blood and gold."
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "she",
      "text": "“One more,”"
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt nodded, his eyes never leaving the horizon."
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“The last encampment."
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Intel from the freed at Hub Needle confirms it."
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Designation: Nibiru’s Grasp."
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Four hundred souls in chains."
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Five hundred defenders."
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Maybe more.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“They know we’re coming.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“They know three encampments have gone dark. They’ll be ready. Not complacent. Not sloppy. Ready.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 30,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika picked up a shattered piece of Anunnaki drone, turning it over in her hand."
    },
    {
      "line": 31,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Two hundred and ninety of us."
    },
    {
      "line": 32,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Half wounded."
    },
    {
      "line": 33,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "All exhausted."
    },
    {
      "line": 34,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Five are still in stasis."
    },
    {
      "line": 35,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No cosmic cavalry.” She tossed the shard aside."
    },
    {
      "line": 36,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“It’s a terrible idea.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 38,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“It’s the only idea,”"
    },
    {
      "line": 39,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt rumbled, pushing off the column. The armor creaked, scales whispering. “We didn’t start this to leave one camp in chains. We finish it. Then we’re done. The mission is complete.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 41,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The word complete hung between them, heavy with promise and dread."
    },
    {
      "line": 42,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Completion meant no more night raids, no more watching friends die under energy whips, no more liberating hollow-eyed survivors who didn’t know how to be free."
    },
    {
      "line": 43,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It also meant no more purpose."
    },
    {
      "line": 44,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "What came after?"
    },
    {
      "line": 46,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Around them, the Legion was already moving."
    },
    {
      "line": 47,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not with the fierce energy of before, but with the grim, automatic rhythm of veterans on a final march."
    },
    {
      "line": 48,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Weapons were cleaned with methodical slowness."
    },
    {
      "line": 49,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Last scraps of rations were shared."
    },
    {
      "line": 50,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Medics moved among the wounded, making hard choices about who could walk and who would be carried."
    },
    {
      "line": 52,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A young soldier—barely more than a boy, his face still smudged with Hub Needle’s soot—approached, his eyes wide."
    },
    {
      "line": 53,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Commander?"
    },
    {
      "line": 54,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Is it true?"
    },
    {
      "line": 55,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The last one?”"
    },
    {
      "line": 57,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Geralt",
      "text": "“Yes,”"
    },
    {
      "line": 59,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The boy’s throat worked."
    },
    {
      "line": 60,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“My sister… she was taken in the last harvest from the Eastern Vale."
    },
    {
      "line": 61,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They might have sent her…”"
    },
    {
      "line": 63,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“We’ll find out,”"
    },
    {
      "line": 64,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika cut in, her voice softening just a fraction. “Get your kit ready. It’s a hard march west.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 66,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "As the boy hurried off, Geralt looked at Mika."
    },
    {
      "line": 67,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“We don’t have to give a speech."
    },
    {
      "line": 68,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They know.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 70,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Mika",
      "text": "“They also know the odds,”"
    },
    {
      "line": 72,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“Then they know this is what we are. This is the line. One more. Then we rest.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 74,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The sun dipped lower."
    },
    {
      "line": 75,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The order was passed not by shout, but by a look, a nod, a gesture."
    },
    {
      "line": 76,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Two hundred and ninety turned as one, facing west."
    },
    {
      "line": 77,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Toward the last slavers."
    },
    {
      "line": 78,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Toward the last fight."
    },
    {
      "line": 79,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The dragon armor on Geralt’s chest felt cool, inert, a dormant shell."
    },
    {
      "line": 80,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It hadn’t changed since the crash."
    },
    {
      "line": 81,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was still just a breastplate and a promise."
    },
    {
      "line": 82,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "As the column began to move, the shadow they cast was long, thin, and bleeding into the dusk."
    },
    {
      "line": 84,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 86,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 2: THE APPROACH"
    },
    {
      "line": 88,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The march took two days through broken badlands."
    },
    {
      "line": 89,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They found the scout’s body on the morning of the third day."
    },
    {
      "line": 91,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Talven—what was left of him—was strung up on a rusted pylon five hundred yards from the encampment’s outer sensor range."
    },
    {
      "line": 92,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A clear message."
    },
    {
      "line": 93,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We see you."
    },
    {
      "line": 95,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika studied the compound through magnoculars from a rocky overlook."
    },
    {
      "line": 96,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Damn.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 98,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Nibiru’s Grasp wasn’t like the other camps—makeshift prisons of force-fences and prefab barracks."
    },
    {
      "line": 99,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This was a fortress."
    },
    {
      "line": 100,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tiered defensive walls carved from the local red stone, reinforced with shimmering energy lattice."
    },
    {
      "line": 101,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gun emplacements at staggered heights."
    },
    {
      "line": 102,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A central tower with a dish that pulsed slowly, scanning the horizon."
    },
    {
      "line": 103,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And patrolling the walls, not just the hulking Anunnaki guards, but sleek combat drones, hovering on silent repulsors."
    },
    {
      "line": 105,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“They’ve had time to prepare,”"
    },
    {
      "line": 106,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Kress muttered, crouching beside Mika. “They’ve been watching the other camps fall. They’ve adapted.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 108,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt took the magnoculars."
    },
    {
      "line": 109,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The slave quarters were easy to spot—a sunken yard in the compound’s center, surrounded by high walls."
    },
    {
      "line": 110,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He could see tiny figures moving listlessly down there."
    },
    {
      "line": 111,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Four hundred."
    },
    {
      "line": 112,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Maybe more."
    },
    {
      "line": 113,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The math was brutal."
    },
    {
      "line": 115,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "he",
      "text": "“Two hundred and ninety,”"
    },
    {
      "line": 117,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The command huddle—Geralt, Mika, Kress, and a few scarred squad leaders—was silent."
    },
    {
      "line": 118,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The wind whistled over the rocks."
    },
    {
      "line": 120,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“Could infiltrate,”"
    },
    {
      "line": 121,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "one leader, Grenn, suggested. He’d lost an ear to a whip at the second camp. “Small team. Sabotage the power core for the energy lattice. Create a breach.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 123,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“Scans show the core’s deep inside the central tower,”"
    },
    {
      "line": 124,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Kress countered, tapping a crude map drawn from Talven’s earlier, safer recon. “Guarded. And they’ll be watching for that exact play. They know our pattern by now.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 126,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Mika",
      "text": "“Then we don’t use our pattern,”"
    },
    {
      "line": 128,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A beat of stunned silence."
    },
    {
      "line": 130,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“You’re joking,”"
    },
    {
      "line": 131,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Grenn breathed."
    },
    {
      "line": 133,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Kress",
      "text": "“They’ll have the walls fortified, the approaches mined,”"
    },
    {
      "line": 135,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“Yes,”"
    },
    {
      "line": 136,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika agreed. “Which is why that’s the diversion.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 138,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She pointed to the map."
    },
    {
      "line": 139,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“We hit them here, at the main gate, with everything we have that’s loud and flashy."
    },
    {
      "line": 140,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Every charge, every bit of ranged fire, all our remaining heavy weapons."
    },
    {
      "line": 141,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We make it look like a desperate, furious, final charge.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 143,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt saw it."
    },
    {
      "line": 144,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“They’ll commit their reserves to repel it."
    },
    {
      "line": 145,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Pull guards from the interior, especially the inner yard walls.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 147,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“Exactly. While the main force is tangling at the gate, a small team—five, six max—goes in here.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 148,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She pointed to a spot on the northern wall where the stone met a natural rock formation. “It’s the one spot their energy lattice is patchy, blending with the mineral deposits. Talven’s last report noted a blind spot in the drone patrol cycle there, thirty-seven seconds. We get a team over that wall during the cycle, into the lower maintenance conduits. They get to the slave pens, get the doors open from the inside. When the slaves riot, the whole interior defense collapses.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 150,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Geralt",
      "text": "“The team in the conduit will be trapped,”"
    },
    {
      "line": 152,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“They will,”"
    },
    {
      "line": 153,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika met his gaze. “It’s a death sentence. Or a capture sentence, which is worse.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 155,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The silence returned, heavier."
    },
    {
      "line": 156,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This was the calculus of their war."
    },
    {
      "line": 157,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not glorious charges, but grim percentages."
    },
    {
      "line": 158,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sacrifice a few to save the many."
    },
    {
      "line": 160,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Geralt",
      "text": "“I’ll lead the diversion,”"
    },
    {
      "line": 162,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Mika",
      "text": "“No,”"
    },
    {
      "line": 164,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“Absolutely not—”"
    },
    {
      "line": 166,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“It’s the right tactical choice, Geralt, and you know it.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 167,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her voice was steel. “You’re too big, your armor signature is unique. They’ll be scanning for you. If you vanish from the frontal assault, they’ll know. I’m smaller, faster, and they won’t be looking for the commander in the pipes.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 169,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He wanted to argue."
    },
    {
      "line": 170,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "To forbid it."
    },
    {
      "line": 171,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But the Legionnaire in him, the strategist, knew she was right."
    },
    {
      "line": 172,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The emotion clawed at his throat, but he forced it down."
    },
    {
      "line": 173,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He gave a single, stiff nod."
    },
    {
      "line": 175,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Kress let out a long breath."
    },
    {
      "line": 176,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Alright."
    },
    {
      "line": 177,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "So we sell the hell out of the diversion."
    },
    {
      "line": 178,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Make it the only fight they think exists.” She started assigning squads, outlining firing positions, fallback lines that weren’t really for falling back, but for dying in place to sell the lie."
    },
    {
      "line": 180,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "As the others dispersed to prepare, Geralt caught Mika’s arm."
    },
    {
      "line": 181,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Thirty-seven seconds.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 183,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“I know.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 185,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“If you’re late…”"
    },
    {
      "line": 187,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“Then we die in the pipes, and you die at the gate, and the slaves stay in chains.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 188,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She put her hand over his. “We don’t have a better option.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 190,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He looked at her, really looked—at the fatigue etched around her eyes, at the determination that held her upright."
    },
    {
      "line": 191,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“After this,” he said, the vow quieter than a whisper."
    },
    {
      "line": 192,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“After this, we find a quiet valley.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 194,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A ghost of a smile touched her lips."
    },
    {
      "line": 195,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Deal.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 197,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Below them, the Legion prepared for a terrible, final gamble."
    },
    {
      "line": 198,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Weapons were checked with solemn care."
    },
    {
      "line": 199,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Letters to no one were written in the dirt and then scuffed away."
    },
    {
      "line": 200,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The dragon armor on Geralt’s chest felt like a dead weight."
    },
    {
      "line": 201,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It had not stirred."
    },
    {
      "line": 202,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It had not answered his silent, desperate plea for more."
    },
    {
      "line": 203,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was just armor."
    },
    {
      "line": 204,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And it would not be enough."
    },
    {
      "line": 206,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 208,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 3: THE ASSAULT FAILS"
    },
    {
      "line": 210,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The attack began at dusk, when the sinking sun glared directly into the compound’s western sensors."
    },
    {
      "line": 211,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It started not with a whisper, but with a roar."
    },
    {
      "line": 213,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Every remaining explosive charge, every rocket, every concentrated energy blast the Legion had salvaged erupted against the main gate in a concussive, blinding wave."
    },
    {
      "line": 214,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stone shattered."
    },
    {
      "line": 215,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The energy lattice flickered violently, overloading in a cascade of blue sparks."
    },
    {
      "line": 216,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Klaxons wailed, drowning the world in sound."
    },
    {
      "line": 218,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“LEGION! WITH ME!”"
    },
    {
      "line": 219,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt bellowed, his voice raw, and charged from the cover of the rocks."
    },
    {
      "line": 221,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Two hundred voices rose in a ragged, furious cry, and they followed him into the killing zone."
    },
    {
      "line": 223,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "For a moment, it worked."
    },
    {
      "line": 224,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The defenders, concentrated on the walls, were stunned by the sheer audacity of the frontal charge."
    },
    {
      "line": 225,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The first volley of Legion fire took down a dozen guards, their bodies tumbling from the parapets."
    },
    {
      "line": 227,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then Nibiru’s Grasp woke up."
    },
    {
      "line": 229,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The compound didn’t panic."
    },
    {
      "line": 230,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It reacted."
    },
    {
      "line": 231,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Blaster turrets emerged from hidden ports in the walls, sweeping intersecting fields of fire across the approach."
    },
    {
      "line": 232,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The combat drones, held in reserve, streaked from the central tower, raining precise plasma bolts down on the charging figures."
    },
    {
      "line": 233,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mines, buried and forgotten until now, detonated in geysers of rock and blood."
    },
    {
      "line": 235,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s world narrowed to fire, noise, and death."
    },
    {
      "line": 236,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He ran, the dragon armor deflecting glancing bolts that would have cooked a normal man."
    },
    {
      "line": 237,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He fired his energy staff, the recoil a steady beat against his palm."
    },
    {
      "line": 238,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A soldier to his left vanished in a flash of light."
    },
    {
      "line": 239,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Another fell, screaming, his leg gone below the knee."
    },
    {
      "line": 241,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“KEEP MOVING! DON’T STOP!”"
    },
    {
      "line": 242,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He crashed into a low barricade of shattered stone, Legionnaires scrambling in beside him. The charge had stalled barely a third of the way to the gate. They were pinned."
    },
    {
      "line": 244,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He risked a glance toward the northern wall."
    },
    {
      "line": 245,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No signal."
    },
    {
      "line": 246,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No explosion."
    },
    {
      "line": 247,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Nothing."
    },
    {
      "line": 248,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Thirty-seven seconds."
    },
    {
      "line": 249,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika was in the pipes, or she was dead."
    },
    {
      "line": 251,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“Sir! Left flank!”"
    },
    {
      "line": 252,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Kress yelled, her face streaked with soot. A squad of Anunnaki shock troops, massive in powered armor, were marching in a solid line from a sally port, heavy repeaters braced on their arms. They began to fire, walking their shots toward the barricade. Stone vaporized."
    },
    {
      "line": 254,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt raised his staff, but the range was too great."
    },
    {
      "line": 255,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The charge pinged harmlessly off the shock troops’ armor."
    },
    {
      "line": 256,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Fall back to the secondary ridge!” he ordered, the words tasting like ash."
    },
    {
      "line": 257,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A retreat now would collapse the diversion."
    },
    {
      "line": 258,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It would doom Mika’s team."
    },
    {
      "line": 259,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But staying was annihilation."
    },
    {
      "line": 261,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They tried to pull back."
    },
    {
      "line": 262,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was a slaughter."
    },
    {
      "line": 263,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The drones harried them, the turrets tracked them."
    },
    {
      "line": 264,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Men and women fell with every step."
    },
    {
      "line": 265,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt found himself as the rearguard, firing, moving, dragging a wounded soldier with him."
    },
    {
      "line": 266,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The vestigial wings on his back trembled uselessly."
    },
    {
      "line": 268,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He made it to the slightly higher ground of the secondary ridge with maybe a hundred and fifty survivors."
    },
    {
      "line": 269,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They huddled behind rocks, gasping, bleeding."
    },
    {
      "line": 270,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The charge had failed."
    },
    {
      "line": 271,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The diversion was a bleeding stump."
    },
    {
      "line": 272,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And the full might of the compound was now turning its gaze outward, hunting."
    },
    {
      "line": 274,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then, from the corner of his eye, he saw a flicker of movement on the northern wall."
    },
    {
      "line": 275,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A small explosion—not huge, but precise—at the base of the inner yard wall."
    },
    {
      "line": 276,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika."
    },
    {
      "line": 277,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She’d done it."
    },
    {
      "line": 278,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She was in."
    },
    {
      "line": 279,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The slave pens were breached."
    },
    {
      "line": 281,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But the compound’s response was instant."
    },
    {
      "line": 282,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The central tower dish pulsed."
    },
    {
      "line": 283,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A different siren blared—interior breach."
    },
    {
      "line": 284,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Instead of chaos, the response was chillingly orderly."
    },
    {
      "line": 285,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The shock troops halted their advance."
    },
    {
      "line": 286,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Half the drones peeled away, shooting back toward the compound’s heart."
    },
    {
      "line": 287,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They hadn’t pulled guards from the interior to the gate; they had a layered, flexible defense ready for exactly this."
    },
    {
      "line": 289,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The main gate itself then groaned open."
    },
    {
      "line": 290,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not a crack."
    },
    {
      "line": 291,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Fully."
    },
    {
      "line": 292,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And from within marched not more shock troops, but a phalanx of gleaming, golden automata—tall, faceless, wielding staves that crackled with containment energy."
    },
    {
      "line": 293,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Reserve units."
    },
    {
      "line": 294,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Fresh."
    },
    {
      "line": 295,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Unbloodied."
    },
    {
      "line": 297,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Kress",
      "text": "“Oh, gods,”"
    },
    {
      "line": 299,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The automata advanced in perfect sync, their staves raising as one."
    },
    {
      "line": 300,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A wall of golden light erupted from their tips, a shimmering, buzzing net of energy that rolled toward the Legion’s position."
    },
    {
      "line": 302,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“Scatter!”"
    },
    {
      "line": 303,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt roared."
    },
    {
      "line": 305,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was too late."
    },
    {
      "line": 306,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The energy net passed over the ridge."
    },
    {
      "line": 307,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It didn’t burn; it paralyzed."
    },
    {
      "line": 308,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires stiffened and dropped, muscles locked, weapons falling from nerveless fingers."
    },
    {
      "line": 309,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt felt the charge hit the dragon armor."
    },
    {
      "line": 310,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The scales flared hot, resisting, grounding out the current, but the shock still sent him to his knees, his vision swimming."
    },
    {
      "line": 312,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The automata kept coming."
    },
    {
      "line": 313,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Behind them, the shock troops advanced again."
    },
    {
      "line": 314,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were being methodically crushed."
    },
    {
      "line": 316,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt forced himself up."
    },
    {
      "line": 317,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Maybe forty of his people were still moving, struggling to their feet."
    },
    {
      "line": 318,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The rest lay twitching on the ground, helpless."
    },
    {
      "line": 319,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The drones began to descend for clean-up shots."
    },
    {
      "line": 321,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This was it."
    },
    {
      "line": 322,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The failure."
    },
    {
      "line": 323,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The end of the line."
    },
    {
      "line": 324,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He saw Mika’s face in his mind."
    },
    {
      "line": 325,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He’d promised her a valley."
    },
    {
      "line": 327,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "An energy bolt meant for his head streaked in."
    },
    {
      "line": 328,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Instinctively, he tried to twist away."
    },
    {
      "line": 329,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The vestigial wing-nub on his back jerked spastically, pitifully, toward the blast."
    },
    {
      "line": 330,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was vaporized in a flash of pain."
    },
    {
      "line": 331,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The bolt slammed into his shoulder instead, spinning him around."
    },
    {
      "line": 333,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A second bolt came from the right."
    },
    {
      "line": 334,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A third from directly ahead, from the leader of the automata."
    },
    {
      "line": 335,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Triangulated."
    },
    {
      "line": 336,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Kill shot."
    },
    {
      "line": 338,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He was out of moves."
    },
    {
      "line": 339,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Out of time."
    },
    {
      "line": 340,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He had nothing left but the defiant, useless rage in his chest."
    },
    {
      "line": 342,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And in that nanosecond before the intersecting blasts tore him apart, something within the dragon armor—something ancient, proud, and furious at this indignity—finally snapped."
    },
    {
      "line": 344,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A voice, not heard but FELT, roared through every fiber of his being, through every scale on the breastplate:"
    },
    {
      "line": 346,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"NOT. LIKE. THIS.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 348,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 4: THE EVOLUTION"
    },
    {
      "line": 350,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The world fractured into light and fury."
    },
    {
      "line": 352,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Three energy blasts converged on Geralt—from the left, the right, and center—a perfect, inescapable kill box."
    },
    {
      "line": 353,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "In that sliver of a second before impact, the dragon armor didn’t just react."
    },
    {
      "line": 354,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It awoke."
    },
    {
      "line": 356,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"NOT. LIKE. THIS.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 358,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The voice was not sound."
    },
    {
      "line": 359,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was a seismic tremor in his soul, a roar of primal defiance that shook his bones and sparked in his blood."
    },
    {
      "line": 360,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was Zaron."
    },
    {
      "line": 362,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The dormant scales on Geralt’s breastplate rippled."
    },
    {
      "line": 363,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then they flowed."
    },
    {
      "line": 365,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was not a gentle transformation."
    },
    {
      "line": 366,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was a violent, rapid reforging."
    },
    {
      "line": 367,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Metallic, sapphire-blue scales surged from the central core, pouring over his shoulders, down his biceps and triceps in interlocking plates."
    },
    {
      "line": 368,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They raced down his thighs, over his kneecaps, sheathing his limbs in articulated armor."
    },
    {
      "line": 369,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It felt less like dressing and more like being claimed—a second skin of immense, ancient power hammered into place."
    },
    {
      "line": 371,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But the wings—the vestigial, itching nubs—were the true revelation."
    },
    {
      "line": 373,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They didn't grow."
    },
    {
      "line": 374,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They unfurled."
    },
    {
      "line": 376,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "With a sound like a hundred great sails catching the wind, they exploded from his back."
    },
    {
      "line": 377,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were vast, semi-translucent, and shimmering with an internal lattice of gold and cobalt energy."
    },
    {
      "line": 378,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were not feather, not membrane, but solid, sculpted light—dragon wings made real."
    },
    {
      "line": 380,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The three energy blasts hit."
    },
    {
      "line": 382,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "CRACK-BOOM-ZZZT!"
    },
    {
      "line": 384,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The world turned white."
    },
    {
      "line": 385,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But Geralt was not vaporized."
    },
    {
      "line": 387,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The newly formed wings had snapped forward on instinct, curving around him in a sweeping, protective arc."
    },
    {
      "line": 388,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They met the blasts not as flesh, but as shields."
    },
    {
      "line": 389,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The energy detonated against their surface in cascading, eye-searing fireworks."
    },
    {
      "line": 390,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The concussive force slammed Geralt into the dirt, skidding him back ten feet, but he was intact."
    },
    {
      "line": 391,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The wings shimmered, dissipating the residual energy with a low, angry hum."
    },
    {
      "line": 393,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence, for one heartbeat."
    },
    {
      "line": 395,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt pushed himself up on one elbow, coughing dust."
    },
    {
      "line": 396,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He looked at his arms."
    },
    {
      "line": 397,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Plated from shoulder to elbow."
    },
    {
      "line": 398,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He looked at his legs."
    },
    {
      "line": 399,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Armored to the knee."
    },
    {
      "line": 400,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He felt the weight of the wings—immense, powerful, real—anchored to his back."
    },
    {
      "line": 401,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They thrummed with potential."
    },
    {
      "line": 403,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Across the field, the lead golden automaton tilted its faceless head."
    },
    {
      "line": 404,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It recalibrated."
    },
    {
      "line": 405,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Its staff pulsed, charging another blast."
    },
    {
      "line": 407,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Move."
    },
    {
      "line": 408,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The thought was his, but the instinct was the armor’s."
    },
    {
      "line": 410,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt flexed his legs, and the world sank."
    },
    {
      "line": 411,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Or he rose."
    },
    {
      "line": 412,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "With a powerful, thunderclap whoomp of displaced air, the wings beat down once, a mighty, foundational stroke."
    },
    {
      "line": 414,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He launched upward, not like a man jumping, but like a catapult firing."
    },
    {
      "line": 415,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He rocketed twenty-five feet straight into the air, clearing the ridge in a blur."
    },
    {
      "line": 416,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The automaton’s blast tore through the space where he’d knelt."
    },
    {
      "line": 418,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He hung, suspended at the apex for a dizzying moment, the wings beating hard to hold position."
    },
    {
      "line": 419,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The battlefield sprawled below him—the pinned Legion, the advancing shock troops, the gleaming automata."
    },
    {
      "line": 420,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The perspective was terrifying, exhilarating."
    },
    {
      "line": 422,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Land."
    },
    {
      "line": 423,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Now."
    },
    {
      "line": 425,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He willed himself forward."
    },
    {
      "line": 426,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The wings angled, caught the air, and he glided."
    },
    {
      "line": 427,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It wasn’t flight."
    },
    {
      "line": 428,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was a controlled, powerful, plummeting swoop."
    },
    {
      "line": 429,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He descended like a falling star, aiming for the center of the automata phalanx."
    },
    {
      "line": 431,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"FLY!\""
    },
    {
      "line": 432,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "someone, maybe Kress, screamed from below, voice shredded with hope."
    },
    {
      "line": 434,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He couldn’t."
    },
    {
      "line": 435,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not yet."
    },
    {
      "line": 436,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But he could fall with purpose."
    },
    {
      "line": 438,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He crashed into the middle of the golden constructs, wings tucking in at the last second to become battering rams."
    },
    {
      "line": 439,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Two automata were smashed apart like porcelain."
    },
    {
      "line": 440,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He landed in a three-point crouch, the impact cratering the earth."
    },
    {
      "line": 441,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The remaining automata turned, staves rising."
    },
    {
      "line": 443,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt didn’t rise."
    },
    {
      "line": 444,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He sprang—another short, powerful wing-assisted leap, clearing a sweeping staff strike."
    },
    {
      "line": 445,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He landed behind a construct, his armored forearm flashing out."
    },
    {
      "line": 446,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The enhanced limb moved with shocking speed and power, shearing through the automaton’s neck-node in a shower of sparks."
    },
    {
      "line": 448,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He was a whirlwind."
    },
    {
      "line": 449,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The wings were his greatest weapon—not for flying, but for mobility and defense."
    },
    {
      "line": 450,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He’d leap over a blast, using the height to survey the field."
    },
    {
      "line": 451,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He’d glide across a gap, closing distance faster than anything on foot."
    },
    {
      "line": 452,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "When projectiles came, a wing would snap around, deflecting them with a resonant clang."
    },
    {
      "line": 454,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "An energy net shot from a turret."
    },
    {
      "line": 455,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He saw it coming, beat his wings once, and vaulted backward, the net snapping shut on empty air."
    },
    {
      "line": 456,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He landed, skidded, and used the momentum to spin, a wing slicing out like a giant blade to cleave a shock trooper’s weapon in two."
    },
    {
      "line": 458,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The tide of battle didn't just turn—it reversed."
    },
    {
      "line": 460,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Legionnaires, seeing their commander transformed into a mythical dragon-knight rising from their defeat, found a second wind."
    },
    {
      "line": 461,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their ragged cries turned into a unified roar."
    },
    {
      "line": 463,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"WITH THE COMMANDER! FOR THE LEGION!\""
    },
    {
      "line": 465,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They rose from their cover and charged, not as a broken diversion, but as a hammer behind Geralt’s anvil."
    },
    {
      "line": 467,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt fought toward the main gate, now a beacon."
    },
    {
      "line": 468,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A shock trooper leveled a heavy plasma cannon at him."
    },
    {
      "line": 469,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt dropped into a slide, the wings flaring out to either side, acting as stabilizers and shields."
    },
    {
      "line": 470,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Bolts sizzled over his head."
    },
    {
      "line": 471,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He came up inside the trooper’s guard, his armored fist driven by the dragon’s strength punching straight through the powered chest plate."
    },
    {
      "line": 473,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He yanked his arm free, turning to face the next threat."
    },
    {
      "line": 474,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His breath came in ragged gasps."
    },
    {
      "line": 475,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The evolution hadn't made him tireless."
    },
    {
      "line": 476,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was draining, a furnace burning hot and fast inside him."
    },
    {
      "line": 478,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zaron’s presence vibrated in his mind, a constant, low growl of satisfaction and impatience."
    },
    {
      "line": 479,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "More."
    },
    {
      "line": 480,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Faster."
    },
    {
      "line": 482,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Can we fly?\""
    },
    {
      "line": 483,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt thought, desperate to get to the interior, to Mika."
    },
    {
      "line": 485,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A pulse of negation, almost scornful, echoed back."
    },
    {
      "line": 486,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "An image flashed in his mind: the wings, strong but simple in structure; muscles and conduits not yet developed for sustained lift; a weight-to-power ratio that was still terrestrial."
    },
    {
      "line": 487,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The understanding was instinctual: Stage 1."
    },
    {
      "line": 488,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We glide."
    },
    {
      "line": 489,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not fly."
    },
    {
      "line": 490,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Yet."
    },
    {
      "line": 492,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But gliding was enough."
    },
    {
      "line": 493,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gliding was everything."
    },
    {
      "line": 495,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He scaled a pile of rubble, beat his wings, and glided over the heads of a stunned Anunnaki squad, landing at the breached main gate."
    },
    {
      "line": 496,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Legion poured in behind him."
    },
    {
      "line": 498,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The interior of Nibiru’s Grasp was chaos—but a chaos they could now use."
    },
    {
      "line": 499,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The defenders, their perfect discipline broken by the dragon-knight’s rampage, were scrambling."
    },
    {
      "line": 500,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And from the heart of the compound, a new sound was rising: the roaring fury of four hundred liberated slaves."
    },
    {
      "line": 502,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika had done her part."
    },
    {
      "line": 504,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 506,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 5: THE LIBERATION & THE CHRONARCH"
    },
    {
      "line": 508,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The tide had turned, but the tide was not the ocean."
    },
    {
      "line": 510,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt stood in the shattered gateway, his new wings flexing with a sound like grinding tectonic plates."
    },
    {
      "line": 511,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Behind him, the Legion poured into the compound, meeting the freed slaves in a chaotic, roaring convergence."
    },
    {
      "line": 512,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Four hundred emaciated, furious souls were tearing apart the inner yard with their bare hands, seizing weapons from fallen guards, turning the Anunnaki’s own architecture into rubble."
    },
    {
      "line": 514,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But the central tower remained."
    },
    {
      "line": 515,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A silent, gleaming obsidian spike at the heart of the chaos."
    },
    {
      "line": 516,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Its energy dish had gone dark."
    },
    {
      "line": 517,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No more drones emerged."
    },
    {
      "line": 518,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It felt not defeated, but waiting."
    },
    {
      "line": 520,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika emerged from a maintenance conduit, her face streaked with grime and blood that wasn’t her own."
    },
    {
      "line": 521,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She saw Geralt and for a moment, her fierce composure broke into raw, stunned awe."
    },
    {
      "line": 522,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Your… wings.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 524,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "he",
      "text": "“They don’t fly,”"
    },
    {
      "line": 526,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“Good enough.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 527,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She nodded toward the tower. “Core’s in there. But it’s… quiet. Too quiet.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 529,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt felt it too."
    },
    {
      "line": 530,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A pressure in the air, a thinning of reality around the tower’s base."
    },
    {
      "line": 531,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The dragon scales on his arms tingled in warning."
    },
    {
      "line": 533,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“Get the slaves clear,”"
    },
    {
      "line": 534,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "he ordered. “Kress! Form a perimeter! That tower is not safe.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 536,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "As the orders were shouted, the last of the Anunnaki guards were being overwhelmed."
    },
    {
      "line": 537,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The compound was theirs."
    },
    {
      "line": 538,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But the victory felt hollow, perched on a precipice."
    },
    {
      "line": 540,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then, the air fractured."
    },
    {
      "line": 542,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not with a sound, but with a silence so profound it swallowed the riot."
    },
    {
      "line": 543,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A vertical slit of non-light tore open in front of the tower’s main entrance."
    },
    {
      "line": 544,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It did not glow."
    },
    {
      "line": 545,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It consumed light, a rip in the fabric of the world."
    },
    {
      "line": 547,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "From the void stepped Ašar-Ku, the Chronarch of Nibiru."
    },
    {
      "line": 549,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He was not a giant."
    },
    {
      "line": 550,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He was a convergence."
    },
    {
      "line": 551,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His form was humanoid, but assembled from overlapping, shifting temporal layers."
    },
    {
      "line": 552,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One moment he appeared as an ancient Sumerian priest-king in layered robes, the next as a sleek, cybernetic entity of golden alloy and crystal."
    },
    {
      "line": 553,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His face was a smooth oval, etched with glowing cuneiform that constantly rewrote itself."
    },
    {
      "line": 554,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "In one hand he held a staff of intertwined timelines, crystalline and shimmering."
    },
    {
      "line": 555,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "In the other, he cradled a sphere that contained a swirling, miniature galaxy—the Looking Glass Prime, fused to his being."
    },
    {
      "line": 557,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He did not speak."
    },
    {
      "line": 558,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His voice was the grinding of continental plates, the whisper of dying stars, the sigh of a closed timeline."
    },
    {
      "line": 560,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“You break the vessels, but the wine is already spilled.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 562,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The words bypassed ears, imprinting directly into the mind."
    },
    {
      "line": 563,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires and freed slaves alike clutched their heads, staggering under the psychic weight."
    },
    {
      "line": 565,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“I did not conquer time. I became it.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 567,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt stepped forward, his wings flaring wide, casting a jagged shadow."
    },
    {
      "line": 568,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“You’re a slaver."
    },
    {
      "line": 569,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And this is your last day.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 571,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ašar-Ku’s head tilted."
    },
    {
      "line": 572,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The cuneiform flared."
    },
    {
      "line": 573,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Slavery?"
    },
    {
      "line": 574,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I am the Gardener."
    },
    {
      "line": 575,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Pruning the branches of possibility."
    },
    {
      "line": 576,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "These…” He gestured with his staff toward the cowering slaves."
    },
    {
      "line": 577,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“…are but seedlings that refused the shape of the pot."
    },
    {
      "line": 578,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You are a weed, Geralt of the Dragon."
    },
    {
      "line": 579,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A fascinating, persistent weed.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 581,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Phase I – The Architect Awakes"
    },
    {
      "line": 583,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ašar-Ku raised his staff."
    },
    {
      "line": 584,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The cuneiform on his body blazed, and a Chrono-Shield shimmered into existence around him—a sphere of rippling, golden hourglass sand."
    },
    {
      "line": 585,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "At the same time, he stamped the base of his staff on the ground."
    },
    {
      "line": 587,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Glyphs of light—Glyphs of Eridu—burned into the stone around him."
    },
    {
      "line": 588,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "From each glyph, a Sumerian war-construct formed: towering, clay golems with lapis lazuli eyes, wielding massive bronze axes."
    },
    {
      "line": 590,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Mika",
      "text": "“Take down the golems!”"
    },
    {
      "line": 592,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Energy staff blasts and physical attacks slammed into Ašar-Ku’s Chrono-Shield."
    },
    {
      "line": 593,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The damage flashed—cracks appearing—but then the sand flowed backward, and the shield repaired itself instantly."
    },
    {
      "line": 594,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He was rewinding damage faster than they could inflict it."
    },
    {
      "line": 596,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt launched himself at the nearest golem, using a wing-assisted jump to clear its sweeping axe."
    },
    {
      "line": 597,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He landed on its shoulder, driving his armored fist into its lapis eye."
    },
    {
      "line": 598,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The construct shattered into dust."
    },
    {
      "line": 599,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But two more took its place."
    },
    {
      "line": 601,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“He’s only healing if we attack from one angle!”"
    },
    {
      "line": 602,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Kress yelled, piecing it together. “We need multiple attack vectors! Simultaneous hits!”"
    },
    {
      "line": 604,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt understood."
    },
    {
      "line": 605,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He beat his wings, gliding high over the battlefield."
    },
    {
      "line": 606,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Mika!"
    },
    {
      "line": 607,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Left flank!"
    },
    {
      "line": 608,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Grenn!"
    },
    {
      "line": 609,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Right!"
    },
    {
      "line": 610,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "On my mark!”"
    },
    {
      "line": 612,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He dove, aiming straight for Ašar-Ku’s head."
    },
    {
      "line": 613,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "As he did, Mika’s squad unleashed a volley from the left, Grenn’s from the right."
    },
    {
      "line": 614,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Three directions at once."
    },
    {
      "line": 616,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Chrono-Shield flared, trying to rewind three separate impact points."
    },
    {
      "line": 617,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It stuttered."
    },
    {
      "line": 618,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A crack webbed across its surface."
    },
    {
      "line": 620,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“Clever weed.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 621,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ašar-Ku’s voice held a note of clinical interest. He raised his sphere. The miniature galaxy within spun faster."
    },
    {
      "line": 623,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Phase II – Devourer of Timelines"
    },
    {
      "line": 625,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The world… stuttered."
    },
    {
      "line": 627,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt felt a horrible lurch, like a missed step in the dark."
    },
    {
      "line": 628,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Around him, the battlefield flickered."
    },
    {
      "line": 629,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He saw overlapping images: a Legionnaire falling in two different directions; a slave frozen mid-cheer, then screaming."
    },
    {
      "line": 631,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“You cherish your past choices. Let us see which one you cannot live without.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 633,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ašar-Ku’s staff pointed at Geralt."
    },
    {
      "line": 634,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A wave of temporal force hit him—not physical, but existential."
    },
    {
      "line": 636,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "TIMELINE COLLAPSE."
    },
    {
      "line": 638,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A memory, a choice, was targeted."
    },
    {
      "line": 639,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The moment Geralt chose to crash the Anunnaki city-ship at the Heart of Faraxar, sacrificing his legion to save a continent."
    },
    {
      "line": 640,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The cornerstone of his legend."
    },
    {
      "line": 641,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The source of his deepest guilt."
    },
    {
      "line": 643,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The memory didn’t just fade."
    },
    {
      "line": 644,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was erased."
    },
    {
      "line": 645,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Unwritten."
    },
    {
      "line": 647,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt screamed, not in pain, but in profound, terrifying disorientation."
    },
    {
      "line": 648,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He knew he had done something momentous, but the why was gone."
    },
    {
      "line": 649,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The faces of the legionnaires who died for him were blurred smudges."
    },
    {
      "line": 650,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The weight of the sacrifice lifted, leaving a terrifying, hollow freedom."
    },
    {
      "line": 651,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Who was he without that burden?"
    },
    {
      "line": 653,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“Geralt!”"
    },
    {
      "line": 654,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika’s voice, desperate."
    },
    {
      "line": 656,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He shook his head, trying to reorient."
    },
    {
      "line": 657,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But the battlefield was fracturing further."
    },
    {
      "line": 658,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Echo Clones of Ašar-Ku flickered into existence—versions of him from failed futures: one scorched and skeletal, one drowned in cosmic ice, one overgrown with crystalline parasites."
    },
    {
      "line": 659,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They moved out of sync with the primary, attacking from impossible angles."
    },
    {
      "line": 661,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ENVIRONMENT HAZARD: REALITY FRACTURE."
    },
    {
      "line": 662,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gravity shifted—suddenly pulling sideways."
    },
    {
      "line": 663,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A freed slave was flung into a wall."
    },
    {
      "line": 664,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then time flow changed: movements became jerky, fast-forwarding, then slowing to a crawl."
    },
    {
      "line": 665,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Causality broke; a Legionnaire fired her staff, but the bolt appeared a second before she pulled the trigger."
    },
    {
      "line": 667,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Chaos."
    },
    {
      "line": 668,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Absolute chaos."
    },
    {
      "line": 670,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt fought through the dissonance, his new armor humming as it tried to stabilize his personal timeline."
    },
    {
      "line": 671,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He saw Mika, moving in slow motion, about to be bisected by an Echo Clone’s temporal blade."
    },
    {
      "line": 673,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "NO."
    },
    {
      "line": 674,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He beat his wings, gliding in a distorted, lurching path through the warped gravity field."
    },
    {
      "line": 675,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He tackled Mika aside just as the blade sheared through the space she’d occupied."
    },
    {
      "line": 677,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“The shield!”"
    },
    {
      "line": 678,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "she gasped, her words stretched and slow. “The… cylinder… seals!”"
    },
    {
      "line": 680,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Cylinder seals!"
    },
    {
      "line": 681,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The ancient Sumerian administrative tools—also used as ritual foci."
    },
    {
      "line": 682,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ašar-Ku’s shield was powered by a foundational, orderly principle."
    },
    {
      "line": 683,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The chaotic reality fracture was a byproduct of his power, not a part of his defense."
    },
    {
      "line": 684,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The shield’s weakness was symmetry, order."
    },
    {
      "line": 686,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s eyes scanned the glowing Glyphs of Eridu on the ground."
    },
    {
      "line": 687,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They weren’t just summoning points."
    },
    {
      "line": 688,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were cylinder seal impressions—intricate patterns telling a story."
    },
    {
      "line": 690,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“We need to align them!”"
    },
    {
      "line": 691,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "he roared, his voice battling the temporal distortion. “Change the story!”"
    },
    {
      "line": 693,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He didn’t know how."
    },
    {
      "line": 694,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But Zaron did."
    },
    {
      "line": 695,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The dragon spirit within the armor, ancient and steeped in symbolic power, surged forward."
    },
    {
      "line": 696,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Knowledge flooded Geralt: the glyphs were a cosmic contract."
    },
    {
      "line": 697,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ašar-Ku’s story was one of control, of pruning, of enforced order."
    },
    {
      "line": 699,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They needed to change the narrative to one of freedom."
    },
    {
      "line": 701,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“Mika! Grenn! Everyone! Scar the glyphs! Break the patterns! Don’t destroy—alter!”"
    },
    {
      "line": 703,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He lunged for the nearest glyph, ignoring an Echo Clone’s swipe that grazed his wing."
    },
    {
      "line": 704,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He drove the tip of his energy staff into the intricate design, not smashing it, but carving a new line through it—a wild, uncharted path."
    },
    {
      "line": 705,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A slave, seeing him, grabbed a piece of rubble and began scratching at another."
    },
    {
      "line": 707,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One by one, the Legion and the freed slaves defaced the perfect, orderly glyphs."
    },
    {
      "line": 708,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They introduced chaos."
    },
    {
      "line": 709,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They introduced choice."
    },
    {
      "line": 711,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ašar-Ku’s shield flickered violently."
    },
    {
      "line": 712,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Echo Clones wavered."
    },
    {
      "line": 713,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The reality fractures began to stabilize."
    },
    {
      "line": 715,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“You introduce… noise.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 716,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Chronarch’s voice held the first hint of strain. “But noise is not a song. It is entropy. I shall teach you the cost of dissonance.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 718,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Phase III – God Beyond Fate"
    },
    {
      "line": 720,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Echo Clones dissolved."
    },
    {
      "line": 721,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Chronarch drew them back into himself, along with all the scattered temporal energy."
    },
    {
      "line": 722,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Looking Glass Prime in his hand blazed like a captured sun."
    },
    {
      "line": 724,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“I offer you a perfect future, Geralt of the Dragon. The one you secretly crave.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 726,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A vision flooded Geralt’s mind, stunning in its clarity: A quiet valley."
    },
    {
      "line": 727,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika, whole and smiling."
    },
    {
      "line": 728,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Five, alive and laughing around a fire."
    },
    {
      "line": 729,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The 250, rescued and building homes."
    },
    {
      "line": 730,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No war."
    },
    {
      "line": 731,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No chains."
    },
    {
      "line": 732,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Peace."
    },
    {
      "line": 733,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His peace."
    },
    {
      "line": 734,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "All he had to do was lay down his staff."
    },
    {
      "line": 735,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stop fighting."
    },
    {
      "line": 736,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Accept Ašar-Ku’s order."
    },
    {
      "line": 738,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was everything he wanted."
    },
    {
      "line": 739,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was a golden cage."
    },
    {
      "line": 741,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“This is logical. This is optimal. Why choose suffering?”"
    },
    {
      "line": 743,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ašar-Ku’s true weakness crystallized in Geralt’s mind."
    },
    {
      "line": 744,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He cannot perceive free will—only probability."
    },
    {
      "line": 745,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "To him, Geralt was a set of data points: warrior, leader, guilty, loves Mika, desires peace."
    },
    {
      "line": 746,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The offer was the perfect algorithm to neutralize him."
    },
    {
      "line": 747,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was what Geralt should want."
    },
    {
      "line": 749,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But free will wasn't about what you should want."
    },
    {
      "line": 750,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was about what you choose, even against your own interests."
    },
    {
      "line": 752,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt looked at the vision of peace."
    },
    {
      "line": 753,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He looked at Mika, real and bloody and fighting beside him."
    },
    {
      "line": 754,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He looked at the freed slaves, choosing to scar the glyphs."
    },
    {
      "line": 756,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He chose the messy, painful, uncertain present."
    },
    {
      "line": 758,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Geralt",
      "text": "“I reject your future,”"
    },
    {
      "line": 760,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He raised his energy staff, not at Ašar-Ku, but at the Looking Glass Prime itself."
    },
    {
      "line": 761,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He didn’t charge it with destructive force."
    },
    {
      "line": 762,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He charged it with a single, clear, illogical memory: the moment he first saw Mika, not as a soldier, but as a person."
    },
    {
      "line": 763,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The moment he chose to trust her against all tactical sense."
    },
    {
      "line": 764,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A choice that made no probability tables."
    },
    {
      "line": 765,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A human choice."
    },
    {
      "line": 767,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He fired."
    },
    {
      "line": 769,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The energy beam, imbued with that irrational spark of connection, hit the Looking Glass."
    },
    {
      "line": 771,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The perfect sphere shattered."
    },
    {
      "line": 773,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not with an explosion, but with a sound like a universe sighing."
    },
    {
      "line": 774,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The galaxy within it winked out."
    },
    {
      "line": 776,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ašar-Ku stared at the broken artifact in his hand, the cuneiform on his face freezing mid-rewrite."
    },
    {
      "line": 777,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“You… chose… the unpredictable variable."
    },
    {
      "line": 778,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The null hypothesis.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 780,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His form began to destabilize, the overlapping timelines peeling apart."
    },
    {
      "line": 781,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He was not being destroyed."
    },
    {
      "line": 782,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He was being unmade from relevance."
    },
    {
      "line": 784,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“I am… removed from the equation. Alive… but irrelevant.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 786,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Chronarch of Nibiru faded, not into light or darkness, but into a transparent, ghostly afterimage, forever sealed outside the flow of causality—a prisoner of his own perfected, lifeless order."
    },
    {
      "line": 788,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The central tower groaned."
    },
    {
      "line": 789,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Without Ašar-Ku’s will, its structural integrity failed."
    },
    {
      "line": 790,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It began to collapse in on itself."
    },
    {
      "line": 792,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“GET CLEAR!”"
    },
    {
      "line": 793,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt bellowed, shepherding the exhausted, victorious crowd toward the shattered gates."
    },
    {
      "line": 795,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They stumbled out onto the bloodied plain as Nibiru’s Grasp imploded behind them, a final tomb for the last Anunnaki slavers on the continent."
    },
    {
      "line": 797,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The sun was rising."
    },
    {
      "line": 798,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The mission was over."
    },
    {
      "line": 800,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt stood at the head of a ragged, combined force: the 210 Legionnaires who could still stand, and the 250 freed slaves who chose to follow them."
    },
    {
      "line": 801,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Four hundred and sixty souls, bathed in dawn’s light, finally free."
    },
    {
      "line": 803,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He folded his new wings against his back, the scales cooling."
    },
    {
      "line": 804,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were part of him now."
    },
    {
      "line": 805,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stage 1."
    },
    {
      "line": 806,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A promise of what was to come."
    },
    {
      "line": 808,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika leaned against him, her breath coming in tired huffs."
    },
    {
      "line": 809,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“A quiet valley,” she murmured, echoing his promise."
    },
    {
      "line": 811,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "he",
      "text": "“Soon,”"
    },
    {
      "line": 813,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 815,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "End of Chapter 44"
    }
  ]
}